+## Separate optimizer training pilot
+
+A Crusoe A100 pilot trained Nemotron Nano 8B LoRA adapters on the original data for three epochs and on a revised curriculum for one epoch. The network-interrupted evaluation completed only two fully paired factories out of twenty planned. On those two cases, the three-epoch adapter reached zero damage on all eight final days; this is exploratory evidence, not a generalization result. The intended nineteen-factory continuation remains incomplete.
+
+The recovered adapters, unchanged-grader audit and VM deletion receipt are documented in [the pilot report](docs/evidence/optimizer-v2-results.md). The separate local viewer runs on port 5193. No pilot result is part of the frozen website or video.
